{"entity_id":"enemy.mimic","entity_type":"enemy","canonical_name":"Mimic / 宝箱怪","language":"zh","aliases":["Mimic","宝箱怪","宝箱改"],"description_short":"宝箱怪是伪装成宝箱的威胁，低等级时不要把它当普通拾取事件处理。","description_long":"看到可疑宝箱或打开后进入战斗时，先稳住血量，不要让脆角色残血。它的作用是提醒玩家探索也可能触发强敌。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.mimic.zh","language":"zh","intent":"strategy","question_patterns":["宝箱怪要小心吗","宝箱改是什么","Mimic 怎么打"],"answer":"宝箱怪不要当普通小怪处理。打开可疑宝箱前尽量保持血量，战斗中先稳住治疗和前排，别让脆角色残血。","source_refs":["gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"enemy.lizardman","entity_type":"enemy","canonical_name":"Lizard Man / 蜥蜴人","language":"zh","aliases":["Lizard Man","蜥蜴人"],"description_short":"蜥蜴人代表早期常见强一点的物理敌人桶，处理思路是集火、控血和避免脆角色被连续攻击。","description_long":"Lite 包不追踪每种敌人的完整属性。遇到比普通怪硬的敌人时，用基本原则处理：集中攻击、保留回复、别让低防角色站在危险位置。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.lizardman.zh","language":"zh","intent":"strategy","question_patterns":["蜥蜴人难打吗","早期硬怪怎么处理"],"answer":"把它当早期偏硬的物理敌人处理：集中火力、保证回复，不要让伊万或米娅这类较脆角色站在连续受击位置。","source_refs":["gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
